      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "We have just completed a massive renovation, covering virtually every part of our house, and our experience with Macedon Ranges Solar was by far the worst part of the entire process.  The initial installation was done wrongly, so that every panel had to be removed and reinstalled.  We then had a number of ongoing issues with the operation of the system.  In spite of this, Luke (owner) insisted that we pay in full before the installers would leave.  Knowing how he operates, I can understand why.  They've basically disappeared on us since then, and it took the threat of the ombudsman to get him to answer my emails and resolve the last remaining issues.Now that the work is basically complete, I am getting zero support when required.  No phone calls returned, no emails replied to. I would go anywhere other than Macedon Ranges Solar.",
