      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Very easy to deal with and down to earth. Being local means they understood my needs (panels on rural shed with a cable back to my switchboard). I was offered REC panels (high quality) at a discounted price. Quality of the installation is great, with dual inverters, however only issue was bits of cable tied were left strewn on the ground around the shed. The electrical install had some hiccups with circuit breakers tripping after on sunny days but that seems to be sorted now after a couple of follow up visits and upgraded units fitted.I have 2 x 5kW systems, each connected to its own phase (2 phase power). Works really well. 32 panels total.Definitely recommend Macedon Ranges Solar Power. Small company and you get to know the individuals. Customer service is very good and are competitive in pricing.",
